---
/**
 * Doc UI kit — Grid: a stylized app data table.
 *
 * Models the handoff's `.mtable`. Author supplies <thead>/<tbody>/<tfoot> as
 * children for full cell control — add `class="num"` for right-aligned mono
 * numerics, `class="mk-name"` / `class="mk-sku"` for item cells, and drop a
 * <Pill> straight into a status cell.
 */
---

<table class="mk-grid"><slot /></table>
